WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.760
But it was about these middle powers

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.260
showing leadership in that direction,

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:09.240
because we're not seeing that leadership from the United States,

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:13.000
we're not seeing it from China, we're not seeing it from Russia.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.210
But then you have India, you have Brazil, you have the European Union,

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.850
you have Canada, you have many countries in Africa.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.610
So the world is very big.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:26.110
The mistake that these big powers are committing

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:29.770
is that they believe we are living in the 20th century,

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.560
but we are living in the 21st century.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.920
There are many other actors with a lot of leverage, with a lot of population

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.350
and with a lot of strengths and assets

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:48.100
to influence the path the world is taking.
